---
source: src/main.rs
expression: help_text
---
Displays a summary of the packages that would be downloaded.

Note that this is not a full list as the SDK uses MSI files for many packages,
so they would need to be downloaded and inspected to determine which CAB files
must also be downloaded to get the content needed.

Usage: list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --wdk-versions
          Lists every WDK version published to nuget instead of the packages,
          marking the one that would be acquired.
          
          Unlike the CRT and SDK, the WDK versions are not in the manifest, so
          this queries nuget.

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
